<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In A Systematic Evaluation of Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning Methods for the Security of Code LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Human Evaluation Methodology and Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In A Systematic Evaluation of Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning Methods for the Security of Code LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Computational Resource Requirements and Efficiency</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
