<tr id="S5.T3.5.1.50" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.5.1.50.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;" colspan="10"><math id="S5.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ast" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∗</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ast</annotation></semantics></math> The number of code snippets for each temperature sampling is <span id="S5.T3.5.1.50.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">81</span>; <math id="S5.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math> Median = <span id="S5.T3.5.1.50.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">41</span> (51.25).</td></tr>
